WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:01.660
(audience applauds)
- Welcome back!

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.650
Before we go, we like to
play a quick round of!

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.177
- Drewth or Dare!

00:00:05.177 --> 00:00:08.102
(audience applauds)

00:00:08.102 --> 00:00:09.030
All right.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:12.270
- Do we have Calmey LaGrandeo?

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.860
Hello!
- Hi! Hi there!

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.384
- [Ross] Okay, best
suit of the day, hello!

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:19.100
- Thank you! Thank you!

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.420
- All right, so what's it gonna be today?

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.732
Is it gonna be a Drewth or a dare?

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:24.720
- Dare!

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.590
- [Ross] Okay.
(audience applauds)

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:29.199
- I like how you revved up for it.

00:00:29.199 --> 00:00:30.032
(Ross makes revving sound)
(audience laughs)

00:00:30.032 --> 00:00:31.070
(indistinct)
What's coming down the pike.

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:31.903
- You ready?

00:00:31.903 --> 00:00:32.736
- [Drew] I think so.

00:00:32.736 --> 00:00:33.730
Yes, always.
- Yes.

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:34.563
- Drew.

00:00:34.563 --> 00:00:35.803
- [Drew] Okay.

00:00:35.803 --> 00:00:38.610
- I dare you to try to crack an egg

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:41.700
without getting any shell in the bowl.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.500
But there's a twist.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.600
Ross will be behind you.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.780
And you have to use his
hands instead of your own.

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:52.920
And Ross will be blindfolded.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.960
- [Drew] I already like this, yeah.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.600
- Drew, your hands will
be behind your back

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.710
and you have to guide
Ross the entire time.

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:02.543
- [Ross] Okay.

00:01:02.543 --> 00:01:04.970
- So it's your hands, my eyes.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.803
- Yes, and we'll work as a unit.

00:01:06.803 --> 00:01:08.286
(audience applauds)

00:01:08.286 --> 00:01:10.345
- [Calmey] You ready? Okay, good luck!

00:01:10.345 --> 00:01:11.178
- Is it in the kitchen?

00:01:11.178 --> 00:01:12.953
- Are we going in the kitchen?

00:01:12.953 --> 00:01:13.786
- Okay.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:17.110
All right, Drew.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.160
- [Calmey] Remember, no shell.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:20.720
No shell in the bowl.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:21.681
- Okay.

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:22.514
- Wait, is this the blindfold?

00:01:22.514 --> 00:01:24.050
- [Calmey] Wear your aprons!

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.130
- Okay, I'm gonna put on this,

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:26.300
I don't want you to get dirty.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:28.014
So I'm gonna put a little...

00:01:28.014 --> 00:01:28.847
- [Drew] Thank you.

00:01:28.847 --> 00:01:29.680
- That's cute, you ready?

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:30.513
All right, cute, cute, cute.

00:01:30.513 --> 00:01:32.560
- You strap me in, I'll strap you in.

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:33.443
- [Ross] Oh!

00:01:33.443 --> 00:01:34.470
- [Audience] Ooh.

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:36.660
- Okay, blind fold me.
- Okay, here.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.040
- And even though I'm in the heels,

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.550
thank you, Rossy, for coming up.

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:40.490
- You can do this.

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.000
- [Ross] I'm gonna get behind you.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:42.833
Guide me.

00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:44.970
- Okay, forward.
- Okay.

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:47.570
- Okay, and now go down and get the eggs.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:48.680
- Oh, that's an egg.
- Yeah.

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:49.860
- Okay.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.690
- Now wait, okay.

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:53.480
Okay, keep your hands straight.

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.881
- [Ross] Well, girl, come
on, I can't do straight.

00:01:55.881 --> 00:01:56.714
(audience laughs)

00:01:56.714 --> 00:01:57.547
- Your hand!

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.603
Keep your hands straight.

00:02:01.776 --> 00:02:02.609
- Okay.

00:02:02.609 --> 00:02:04.313
- Okay, now one, two, three.

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:07.650
(audience laughs)

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:09.820
- [Ross] I think that worked.

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:11.860
- [Drew] All right, pick the bowl up.

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:12.693
- Okay.

00:02:12.693 --> 00:02:14.460
- No. Yeah, get that egg out.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:16.790
- Okay.
(audience laughs)

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:18.243
Here we go, okay.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:22.110
- Okay, now...
- Count me in.

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:23.626
- Okay, you...

00:02:23.626 --> 00:02:24.459
Uh-huh, uh-huh.

00:02:24.459 --> 00:02:26.029
- Okay?
- Right there, right there.

00:02:26.029 --> 00:02:26.862
- Yeah, uh-huh.

00:02:26.862 --> 00:02:28.433
(audience laughs)

00:02:28.433 --> 00:02:30.097
- I'm gonna do a little softer.

00:02:30.097 --> 00:02:32.400
(audience laughs)

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.520
Okay, ready?

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:34.823
Three, two, delicate.

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:37.080
Oh, okay.

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.243
- [Drew] Oh no, this is not gonna go well.

00:02:38.243 --> 00:02:39.550
- [Ross] It's gonna go great.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.271
- [Drew] All right.

00:02:41.271 --> 00:02:44.490
(audience cheers)

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:45.323
- Okay.

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.460
Any shell in the bowl?

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.480
- Calmey, I'm really sad to tell you

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:52.250
there's a tiny bit of shell.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.330
But I am very proud of Rossy,

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:57.508
because not only did the
last egg he get in the bowl,

00:02:57.508 --> 00:02:59.720
he didn't break the yolk.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:03.510
- Thank you so much.
(audience applauds)

00:03:05.746 --> 00:03:06.986
How did I do?

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:08.188
- Look.

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:09.021
- [Ross] Oh God.

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:09.854
- [Drew] You didn't break it.

00:03:09.854 --> 00:03:11.368
- How about that! Hey!

00:03:11.368 --> 00:03:12.320
(audience applauds)

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.317
- [Calmey] Whoo, good job!

00:03:13.317 --> 00:03:14.179
- That wasn't bad.

00:03:14.179 --> 00:03:16.010
- Well, thank you, Calmey.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:17.030
- I have to say, Drew,

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.403
that one really cracked me up.

00:03:19.403 --> 00:03:21.986
(upbeat music)

